  "id": "section-22401",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "22401001",
          "sourceType": 10,
          "text": "「S-VIII」的……好意？",
          "title": "小节引文",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "呼……这是……第几个了？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "喔，让我想想……三，四，五——阿算了，完全记不清了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "不知道多久才能帮主人攒够积分阿……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "？？？",
          "text": "啧，可怜的小玩意们。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "……跟海报上一模一样……活的「S-VIII」……！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "喔——出现了，是坏女人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "怎么了，小东西，你们看起来不是很友善？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "抱歉，可是……你、您来这里做什么！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "别紧张，只是来给你们提供一些，小小的帮助。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "花迦",
          "text": "「无事献殷勤，非奸即盗」……你为什么要帮我们？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "礼尚往来——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "作为「那个人类对我的喜爱」的，一点回礼。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "22401014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "S-VIII",
          "text": "想要尽快攒够积分的话，就跟我来~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
